	(text "Notes\n* eFuse = TPS259470L (latch-off): a DUT short latches until the shield toggles CTRLn.\n  Always-on = TPS259470A (auto-retry). EN/UVLO threshold 1.2 V: 3.3 V logic drives it directly.\n* 20k pull-downs: everything off when the shield is unplugged, unpowered or in reset.\n* Reverse current blocked (back-to-back FETs inside the eFuse). OVLO 14.8 V cuts all outputs.\n* No quick-output-discharge in TPS25947: the LED + 4k7 (2.5 mA) bleeds an unloaded output.\n* Copper: 2 oz both layers. VBUS and OUTn are polygons; see docs/hardware/power-board.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
